rom security guards at the location.\n\nHowever, in the viral video, narration from several people suggested that the black Alphard with license plate D 1828 XHQ was instead suspected of intimidating the security guard who issued the warning.\n\nLater, the Alphard’s license plate was suspected to be fake, prompting Ditlantas Polda Metro Jaya to step in and summon the driver.\n\nMenteng Metro Police Chief AKBP Braiel Arnold Rondonuwu stated that the matter had been mediated at the Thamrin police post or the Bundaran HI police post.\n\nRead the full information at https://t.co/wP16vn5KQq.\n(📷 Viral Video)\n\n#cnnindonesia #cnnindonesiacom #viral"}, "is_available": true}, "is_translatable": true, "legacy": {"bookmark_count": 9, "bookmarked": false, "conversation_id_str": "2080247276103192795", "created_at": "Thu Jul 23 11:02:54 +0000 2026", "display_text_range": [0, 275], "entities": {"media": [{"additional_media_info": {"monetizable": false}, "display_url": "pic.x.com/QzdqZER5Xa", "expanded_url": "https://x.com/CNNIndonesia/status/2080247276103192795/video/1", "ext_media_availability": {"status": "Available"}, "id_str": "2080247129478705152", "indices": [276, 299], "media_key": "13_2080247129478705152", "media_results": {"result": {"media_key": "13_2080247129478705152"}}, "media_url_https": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2080247129478705152/img/wbB1VZdtKOTPLhhC.jpg", "original_info": {"focus_rects": [], "height": 1920, "width": 1080}, "sizes": {"large": {"h": 1920, "resize": "fit", "w": 1080}, "medium": {"h": 1200, "resize": "fit", "w": 675}, "small": {"h": 680, "resize": "fit", "w": 383}, "thumb": {"h": 150, "resize": "crop", "w": 150}}, "type": "video", "url": "https://t.co/QzdqZER5Xa", "video_info": {"aspect_ratio": [9, 16], "duration_millis": 58400, "variants": [{"content_type": "application/x-mpegURL", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2080247129478705152/pl/OAFmp6GzL_AiJ2mB.m3u8?tag=29&v=cfc"}, {"bitrate": 632000, "content_type": "video/m